  "description": "Kanject Core realtime — AddRealtime() and the in-process default transport for Kanject.Core.Realtime.Abstractions (proposal 0058): connections, subscriptions and delivery held in memory, with Core's subscription rules, the product's IRealtimeAuthorizer, the connection observer, inbound frames and every D10 control. For tests and local runs; providers for API Gateway WebSockets and AppSync Events plug into the same builder.",
